Metalocalypse: Army of the Doomstar is a 2023 American direct-to-video adult animated
fantasy film based on the Adult Swim animated series Metalocalypse.

12
00:49:48,000 --> 00:49:54,000
The film is written and directed by series co-creator Brendon Small and is a direct
sequel to the 2013 special, Metalocalypse: The Doomstar Requiem.

13
00:53:57,000 --> 00:54:03,000
The film was released on August 22, 2023, alongside
Dethklok's fourth studio album, Dethalbum IV.

14
00:58:06,000 --> 00:58:12,000
The film was dedicated to longtime series director, Jon
Schnepp, who died in 2018 before production began.

15
01:02:15,000 --> 01:02:21,000
The film is the third and final of Adult Swim's line of straight-to-video movies after Aqua Teen Forever: Plantasm
and The Venture Bros.: Radiant Is the Blood of the Baboon Heart, and was released by Warner Bros.

16
01:06:24,000 --> 01:06:30,000
Home Entertainment.

17
01:10:33,000 --> 01:10:39,000
The film picks up after the events of the Metalocalypse: The Doomstar Requiem special, with Dethklok tasked to write the "song of
salvation" in order to save the planet from impending doom, and serves as the series finale to the Metalocalypse.

18
01:14:42,000 --> 01:14:48,000
